    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-όπισθεν</span></b> , in Poets also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτ-θε</span></b> , Adv. of Place, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>behind, after</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.505
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.92
			</span></i>: c.gen., <i><span class="en">
				12.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
