				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1085.14
			</span></i>: metaph., of rank, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ δ᾽ Ἀρετὰ κ. θνατοῖς ἀμελεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					1093
				</span></i>
